<view
  class="page with-action"
>
  <view
    class="title"
  >拾起这一段成长</view>
  <view
    class="subtitle"
  >让真实的观察与陪伴，成为诗里的光。</view>
  <state-view
    status="{{status}}"
    title="还需要成长的线索"
    message="{{error || '暂无可用对象，请联系管理者。'}}"
    bind:retry="load"
    bind:action="help"
  />
  <block
    wx:if="{{status==='ready'}}"
  >
    <view
      class="field section"
    >
      <view
        class="label"
      >写给哪位孩子</view>
      <picker
        range="{{children}}"
        range-key="name"
        value="{{childIndex}}"
        bindchange="child"
        disabled="{{busy}}"
      >
        <view
          class="input"
        >{{children[childIndex].name}} · {{children[childIndex].grade}}</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
    <view
      class="field"
    >
      <view
        class="label"
      >成长周期</view>
      <picker
        range="{{periods}}"
        value="{{periodIndex}}"
        bindchange="period"
        disabled="{{busy || !periods.length}}"
      >
        <view
          class="input"
        >{{periods[periodIndex] || '暂无有观察的周期'}}</view>
      </picker>
      <view
        class="field-hint"
      >仅展示有有效成长观察的周期。</view>
    </view>
    <state-view
      wx:if="{{periodBusy}}"
      status="loading"
    />
    <view
      wx:if="{{basis}}"
      class="card"
    >
      <view
        class="section-title"
      >本次诗歌的依据</view>
      <view
        class="basis small"
      >{{children[childIndex].name}} · {{basis.period}}
心理 {{basis.psychology}} / 美育 {{basis.aesthetic}} / 财商 {{basis.finance}} / 行为 {{basis.behavior}}</view>
    </view>
    <view
      wx:else
      class="notice"
    >还需要一点成长的线索，请联系管理者补齐观察。</view>
    <view
      class="notice"
    >生成的诗歌会保存到成长诗列表，可在阅读后预览匿名分享卡。封面缺失不影响诗文阅读。</view>
    <view
      wx:if="{{error}}"
      class="error-inline"
    >{{error}}<button
        class="text-btn"
        bindtap="loadPeriods"
      >刷新成长周期</button></view>
    <button
      wx:if="{{uncertain && !busy}}"
      class="btn secondary full"
      bindtap="list"
    >查看已生成诗列表</button>
    <view
      wx:if="{{busy}}"
      class="notice"
    >正在拾起成长的片段。没有后台任务查询能力，离开后请到列表确认结果。</view>
  </block>
  <view
    class="bottom-action"
  >
    <button
      class="btn"
      disabled="{{status!=='ready' || busy || !basis || periodBusy}}"
      bindtap="submit"
    >{{busy?'正在生成诗文':error?'重试本次生成':'生成成长诗'}}</button>
  </view>
</view>
